msgid "Please make sure to properly configure Maps first under Settings > Maps"
msgstr "Sicela uqiniseke ukuthi ulungiselela kahle Amamephu kuqala ngaphansi kwe-Izilungiselelo > Amamephu"

#: gpstemplates.php
